sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Pengguna (admin/pimpinan)
    participant UI as Arsip (list/dialog)
    participant SA as Server Action archive
    participant ST as Storage (bucket images/archives)
    participant DB as Database (archives, archive_logs)

    alt Tambah / Ubah
        U->>UI: isi form (opsional file)
        UI->>SA: createArchive / updateArchive
        opt file baru
            SA->>ST: uploadFile('images','archives', file)
            ST-->>SA: { url, path }
        end
        SA->>DB: INSERT/UPDATE archives
        SA->>DB: INSERT archive_logs(create/update)
    else Hapus
        U->>UI: klik Hapus
        UI->>SA: deleteArchive(id, filePath?)
        opt ada filePath
            SA->>ST: deleteFile('images', filePath)
        end
        SA->>DB: UPDATE archives SET is_deleted=true, deleted_at=now()
        SA->>DB: INSERT archive_logs(delete)
    else Restore (dari Sampah)
        U->>UI: klik Pulihkan
        UI->>SA: restoreArchive(id)
        SA->>DB: UPDATE archives SET is_deleted=false
        SA->>DB: INSERT archive_logs(restore)
    end
    SA-->>UI: toast sukses + revalidatePath
    UI-->>U: tabel termuat ulang